%% Architektur-Scaffolding: Container + Ablauf
flowchart LR
  A[GitHub Issue\n+ Label architecture-scaffolding] --> B[GitHub Actions Workflow]
  B --> C[Scaffolding Orchestrator]

  subgraph Agents[7-Rollen Multi-Agenten-System]
    RA[Requirements Analyst]
    SA[Solution Architect]
    API[API Designer]
    DA[Data Architect]
    SR[Security Reviewer]
    QR[Quality Reviewer]
    HA[Human Approver]
  end

  C --> RA
  RA --> SA
  RA --> API
  RA --> DA
  SA --> SR
  API --> SR
  DA --> SR
  SA --> QR
  API --> QR
  DA --> QR
  SR --> C
  QR --> C
  C --> HA
  HA -->|approved| D[(Artifact Bundle)]
  HA -->|needs revision| C

  D --> E[architecture_summary.json]
  D --> F[diagram.mmd]
  D --> G[openapi.yaml]

  classDef control fill:#0f172a,color:#fff,stroke:#334155;
  class B,C,D control;

---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Stakeholder
  participant GH as GitHub Issue/Label
  participant CI as GitHub Actions
  participant OR as Orchestrator
  participant RA as Requirements Analyst
  participant AD as Architect Team
  participant RV as Security+Quality Reviewer
  participant HA as Human Approver
  participant RE as Repository

  U->>GH: Anforderungen einreichen
  GH->>CI: Trigger bei Label architecture-scaffolding
  CI->>OR: Start Job (ephemeral, read-only, timeout 15m)
  OR->>RA: FR/NFR normalisieren
  RA-->>OR: Strukturierter Requirement-Satz
  OR->>AD: Paralleles Architektur/API/Daten-Design
  AD-->>OR: Entwurfsartefakte
  OR->>RV: Sicherheits- und Qualitätsprüfung
  RV-->>OR: Findings + Freigabestatus
  OR->>HA: Konsolidierten Entwurf zur Entscheidung vorlegen
  alt Freigabe
    HA-->>OR: Approved
    OR->>RE: architecture_summary.json, diagram.mmd, openapi.yaml exportieren
  else Nacharbeit
    HA-->>OR: Revision required
    OR->>AD: Rework mit Findings
  end
